---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

const W = 900;
const H = 372;

function arrow(x1: number, y1: number, x2: number, y2: number) {
  const a = Math.atan2(y2 - y1, x2 - x1);
  const len = 8;
  const p1 = [x2 - len * Math.cos(a - 0.45), y2 - len * Math.sin(a - 0.45)];
  const p2 = [x2 - len * Math.cos(a + 0.45), y2 - len * Math.sin(a + 0.45)];
  return {
    line: `M ${x1} ${y1} L ${x2 - 6 * Math.cos(a)} ${y2 - 6 * Math.sin(a)}`,
    head: `${x2},${y2} ${p1[0].toFixed(1)},${p1[1].toFixed(1)} ${p2[0].toFixed(1)},${p2[1].toFixed(1)}`,
  };
}
---
<figure class="dsc">
  <div class="dsc-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="A client sends a request and gets no reply. Three different failures look identical to it: the request was lost, the server stalled or crashed, or the reply was lost after the server finished the work.">
      <text x="20" y="24" class="t-h" data-lang-en>1. After a timeout, the client sees the same thing in every case</text><text x="20" y="24" class="t-h" data-lang-vi>1. Sau khi hết giờ chờ, client thấy y hệt nhau trong cả ba trường hợp</text>
      <rect x="20" y="66" width="110" height="60" rx="6" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="laptop" x={46} y={96} size={28} /><text x="92" y="100" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b" data-lang-en>Client</text><text x="92" y="100" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b" data-lang-vi>Client</text>
      <rect x="470" y="66" width="120" height="60" rx="6" class="box" />
      <text x="554" y="100" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b" data-lang-en>Server</text><text x="554" y="100" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b" data-lang-vi>Server</text>
      <DiagramIcon name="server" x={496} y={96} size={28} />
      <path d="M 130 84 L 464.0 84.0" class="ln-d" /><polygon points="470,84 462.8,87.5 462.8,80.5" class="hd" />
      <path d="M 466 108 L 134 108" class="ln-d" />
      <path d="M 294 78 L 306 90 M 294 90 L 306 78" class="ln-r" />
      
      <text x="300" y="70" text-anchor="middle" class="t-m" data-lang-en>request</text><text x="300" y="70" text-anchor="middle" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>yêu cầu</text>
      <text x="300" y="132" text-anchor="middle" class="t-m" data-lang-en>reply</text><text x="300" y="132" text-anchor="middle" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>phản hồi</text>
      <text x="610" y="86" class="t-r" data-lang-en>Request lost</text><text x="610" y="86" class="t-r" data-lang-vi>Mất gói đi</text>
      <text x="610" y="104" class="t-m" data-lang-en>The server never saw it.</text><text x="610" y="104" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>Server chưa hề nhận được.</text>
      <text x="610" y="120" class="t-m" data-lang-en>Retrying is safe.</text><text x="610" y="120" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>Thử lại là an toàn.</text>
      <line x1="20" x2="880" y1="146" y2="146" class="ln-g" />
      <rect x="20" y="166" width="110" height="60" rx="6" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="laptop" x={46} y={196} size={28} /><text x="92" y="200" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b" data-lang-en>Client</text><text x="92" y="200" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b" data-lang-vi>Client</text>
      <rect x="470" y="166" width="120" height="60" rx="6" class="box-r" />
      <text x="554" y="200" text-anchor="middle" class="t-r" data-lang-en>Server</text><text x="554" y="200" text-anchor="middle" class="t-r" data-lang-vi>Server</text>
      <DiagramIcon name="server" x={496} y={196} size={28} />
      <path d="M 130 184 L 464.0 184.0" class="ln" /><polygon points="470,184 462.8,187.5 462.8,180.5" class="hd" />
      <path d="M 466 208 L 134 208" class="ln-d" />
      
      <text x="300" y="170" text-anchor="middle" class="t-m" data-lang-en>request</text><text x="300" y="170" text-anchor="middle" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>yêu cầu</text>
      <text x="300" y="232" text-anchor="middle" class="t-m" data-lang-en>reply</text><text x="300" y="232" text-anchor="middle" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>phản hồi</text>
      <text x="610" y="186" class="t-r" data-lang-en>Server stalled or crashed</text><text x="610" y="186" class="t-r" data-lang-vi>Server khựng hoặc sập</text>
      <text x="610" y="204" class="t-m" data-lang-en>It did nothing yet, or only part of it.</text><text x="610" y="204" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>Nó chưa làm gì, hoặc mới làm dở.</text>
      <text x="610" y="220" class="t-m" data-lang-en>Retrying may be safe.</text><text x="610" y="220" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>Thử lại có thể an toàn.</text>
      <line x1="20" x2="880" y1="246" y2="246" class="ln-g" />
      <rect x="20" y="266" width="110" height="60" rx="6" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="laptop" x={46} y={296} size={28} /><text x="92" y="300" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b" data-lang-en>Client</text><text x="92" y="300" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b" data-lang-vi>Client</text>
      <rect x="470" y="266" width="120" height="60" rx="6" class="box" />
      <text x="554" y="300" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b" data-lang-en>Server</text><text x="554" y="300" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b" data-lang-vi>Server</text>
      <DiagramIcon name="server" x={496} y={296} size={28} />
      <path d="M 130 284 L 464.0 284.0" class="ln" /><polygon points="470,284 462.8,287.5 462.8,280.5" class="hd" />
      <path d="M 466 308 L 134 308" class="ln-d" />
      <path d="M 294 302 L 306 314 M 294 314 L 306 302" class="ln-r" />
      
      <text x="300" y="270" text-anchor="middle" class="t-m" data-lang-en>request</text><text x="300" y="270" text-anchor="middle" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>yêu cầu</text>
      <text x="300" y="332" text-anchor="middle" class="t-m" data-lang-en>reply</text><text x="300" y="332" text-anchor="middle" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>phản hồi</text>
      <text x="610" y="286" class="t-r" data-lang-en>Reply lost</text><text x="610" y="286" class="t-r" data-lang-vi>Mất gói về</text>
      <text x="610" y="304" class="t-m" data-lang-en>The server already did the work.</text><text x="610" y="304" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>Server đã làm xong việc.</text>
      <text x="610" y="320" class="t-m" data-lang-en>A blind retry runs it twice.</text><text x="610" y="320" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>Thử lại mù sẽ chạy hai lần.</text>
      <text x="20" y="358" class="t-m" data-lang-en>Dashed = nothing arrived. The red cross is where it broke; the client cannot see it.</text><text x="20" y="358" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>Nét đứt = không có gì tới nơi. Dấu X đỏ là chỗ hỏng; client không nhìn thấy.</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Silence after a timeout has three possible causes, and only one of them is safe to retry blindly. This is why operations need to be idempotent.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Im lặng sau khi hết giờ chờ có ba nguyên nhân, và chỉ một trong ba an toàn nếu thử lại mù. Vì vậy thao tác cần có tính idempotent (chạy lại không đổi kết quả).</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .dsc { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .dsc-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .dsc svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .dsc text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .dsc .t-h { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .dsc .t-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .dsc .t-r { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .dsc .t-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .dsc .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .dsc .box-r { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .dsc .box-d { fill: transparent; stroke: var(--border); stroke-dasharray: 5 4; stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .dsc .box-q { fill: transparent; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-dasharray: 2 4; stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .dsc .ln { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .dsc .ln-r { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .dsc .ln-d { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
  .dsc .ln-g { fill: none; stroke: var(--border); stroke-dasharray: 2 4; }
  .dsc .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .dsc .hd-r { fill: var(--red); }
  .dsc figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
